          %% never OwnWorkNeedsCurrentAIPermission: Duet's own work running & Newer AI permission to allow -- A newer AI permission pauses AI work (Dev 2026-10-25).
          %% never OwnWorkNeedsCurrentTerms: Duet's own work running & Newer Terms to accept -- Newer Terms pause AI work (D7).
